{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_004_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d8e595074be3228bd44be1c060af80d5f2d062826152f10858bd55d472dd9572",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_23:5_01_004_23_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8620f866bf3a6a9f802a06fa7d7a565bbd2af2c497a4408ba73a92197f909608",
      "text": "制作人。情人节巧克力，\n多谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_23:5_01_004_23_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3d794d5242800f8c1062c5482b8c8b80bb8843cc965d867e05e5f7d7693b92b",
      "text": "其实啊，我也想着要送给制作人，\n所以准备了点心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_23:5_01_004_23_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34d792908865309fdb7ca189dee1b4dd277972ea656f5d88aba0c0f13a8046c7",
      "text": "这个，不介意的话就收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_23:5_01_004_23_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f208556a218c959ff02dab90b6506c0ad6bbab79a19b0883407b2c686372407f",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n外观也很讲究，真棒呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_23:5_01_004_23_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c605e2d920d359facbb06f3ca5a525fbbade8af6283dd223610b6cca83efe29",
      "text": "是吧。\n这是我还在当律师时经常去的那家店。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_23:5_01_004_23_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60dd2c5cbae0146018568324bd975f43da8427835aa842945fd31f04083062b0",
      "text": "店主手艺不用多说，人也特别好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_23:5_01_004_23_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b453e806e50565827bbe9f91eeee87f0181d11fc1bb387a893c446958c5f11e4",
      "text": "只要告诉他赠送对象和场合的气氛，\n他就能做出一看就觉得“对对，就是这个！”的点心拼盘呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_23:5_01_004_23_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb26e866d522af74d6a4125c27594c404796b53b7dd11ee203c23c757e24157b",
      "text": "嘛，这次我也提了不少意见，\n所以比平时更加有信心哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_23:5_01_004_23_a:cmd-000051:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbe8834e707a13d28903be72beea7ba0802e84163fa68d7bc7d318d56d7ee10b",
      "text": "我很期待品尝！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_23:5_01_004_23_a:cmd-000052:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0420688995da717abebd35cddbab82603916f05daad92add6f89cf3f7ccc9d40",
      "text": "有好多很棒的点心呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_23:5_01_004_23_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c58f67554ae7a900e3a97dd4a17a56321d0acf9fd097fd8eab89e63885e36a7e",
      "text": "噢！正是想看到制作人这样的表情啊，\n你能喜欢真是太好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
